H Jobs Portal Working at RWTH Working in RWTH’s Scientific Community Working in Management, Administration, Technology & IT Career & Personal Development RWTH Welcome Center Interesting Facts Living in Aachen and Beyond Sustainability Submenu: Sustainability Sustainability Strategy Sustainability Report Sustainability Mission Statement Sustainability Focus Areas Networks Help Build a Sustainable RWTH Newsletter, FAQ and Downloads Faculties Submenu: Faculties Faculty 1 Mathematics and Natural Sciences Faculty 2 Architecture Faculty 3 Civil Engineering Faculty 4 Mechanical Engineering Faculty 5 Georesources and Materials Engineering Faculty 6 Electrical Engineering and Information Technology Faculty 7 Arts and Humanities Faculty 8 Business and Economics Faculty 9 Computer Science Faculty 10 Medicine Information for... Quick Access Prospective Students First Year Students Students Early-Career Researchers Researchers International Alumni School Students Corporate Visitors Press Tools RWTHonline RWTHcontacts RWTHmoodle Intranet Services Dining Hall Menus RWTH Navigator Student Resources and Support Official Announcements Institutions University Library IT Center Center for Teaching and Learning Services Athletics and Recreation Central University Administration Search by Name Search for Search Early-Career Researchers Teaser Copyright: © Martin Braun RWTH Center for Young Academics The Center for Young Academics (CYA) is RWTH’s hub for career development, networking, and support, connecting doctoral candidates, postdocs, and Advanced Talents with the resources they need to thrive. Read More : RWTH Center for Young Academics Copyright: © Martin Braun Career Paths of Junior Researchers at RWTH At RWTH, we provide an ideal environment for early-career researchers, with clear career paths, guidance, and opportunities to grow both within and beyond the University. Read More : Career Paths of Junior Researchers at RWTH Target Groups Copyright: © Martin Braun Doctoral Candidates A doctorate at RWTH offers you the opportunity to conduct research and actively contribute to exciting scientific endeavors using the infrastructure of an excellent university of technology. The doctorate forms the basis for your further academic career. Read More : Doctoral Candidates Copyright: © Heike Lachmann Postdocs As a postdoc at RWTH, you will be part of an interdisciplinary, internationally oriented research environment with excellent, industry-focused infrastructure. This provides you with optimal conditions to advance your scientific career and gain expertise in both research and teaching. Read More : PostDocs Copyright: © Heike Lachmann Advanced Talents Junior professors with or without tenure track appointment, independent junior research group leaders who were selected in a competitive process, postdocs with special awards: you have all successfully navigated the initial challenges on your path to a long-term academic career. Now you belong to the exclusive group of Advanced Talents at RWTH. Read More : Advanced Talents Copyright: © Mirko Krenzel für VolkswagenStiftung Junior Professorship Appointment as a junior professor serves as an important career step for early-career researchers to gain further scientific qualifications after their doctoral studies and prepare for tenure-track positions. RWTH offers exceptional researchers the opportunity to conduct independent research and teach at the University. Successful completion of a term as a junior professor fulfills the prerequisite for being appointed as a full professor. Read More : Junior Professorship Copyright: © Sascha Kreklau Tenure Track Researchers appointed to tenure track positions may advance their career through the tenure track process and, upon successful evaluation, be appointed to a permanent position as a full professor. Read More : Tenure Track Previous item Doctoral Candidates PostDocs Advanced Talents Junior Professorship Tenure Track 1/5 Next item Services for Researchers RWTH offers targeted information, assistance, and advising for new researchers. RWTH Welcome Center RWTH Center for Professional Leadership RWTH Doctoral Academy Research Funding for Early-Career Researchers More on this : Services for Researchers Certificate Courses RWTH's varied certificate courses serve to help researchers enhance their professional profiles. RWTH Research Manager Certificate Course Leadership Extended Certificate Leadership Advanced Certificate NRW Certificate Program – Skills for Careers in Business and Society Footer Services Contact and Directions Legal Notice Privacy Policy Accessibility Statement Site Map Safety Feedback Glossary of Academic Terms Other Portals RWTHonline RWTHcontacts RWTHmoodle RWTH Jobs Portal University Library Athletics and Recreation Intranet RWTH in Simple English Further Institutions © 2026 RWTH Aachen University Social Media Instagram LinkedIn YouTube TikTok Facebook Threads BlueSky Mastodon RWTH Social Media"
    },
