TH Jobs Portal Working at RWTH Working in RWTH’s Scientific Community Working in Management, Administration, Technology & IT Career & Personal Development RWTH Welcome Center Interesting Facts Living in Aachen and Beyond Sustainability Submenu: Sustainability Sustainability Strategy Sustainability Report Sustainability Mission Statement Sustainability Focus Areas Networks Help Build a Sustainable RWTH Newsletter, FAQ and Downloads Faculties Submenu: Faculties Faculty 1 Mathematics and Natural Sciences Faculty 2 Architecture Faculty 3 Civil Engineering Faculty 4 Mechanical Engineering Faculty 5 Georesources and Materials Engineering Faculty 6 Electrical Engineering and Information Technology Faculty 7 Arts and Humanities Faculty 8 Business and Economics Faculty 9 Computer Science Faculty 10 Medicine Information for... Quick Access Prospective Students First Year Students Students Early-Career Researchers Researchers International Alumni School Students Corporate Visitors Press Tools RWTHonline RWTHcontacts RWTHmoodle Intranet Services Dining Hall Menus RWTH Navigator Student Resources and Support Official Announcements Institutions University Library IT Center Center for Teaching and Learning Services Athletics and Recreation Central University Administration Search by Name Search for Search You Are Here: Start Academics During Your Studies Preparing for Your Career Preparing for Your Career Career Bachelor Class Career Master Class Career Services for International Students Dean’s List – Offerings for Students Copyright: © Martin Braun At the Career Center, we’re here to help you launch confidently into the job market and support you as you take those first steps into the professional world. Serving as the University’s central career hub, we connect students with employers and gather essential resources in one convenient place. Contact Anja Robert M.A. Relationship Management Staff Unit Career Center Coordinator, Career and Application Advising, Contact for Companies and Collaborations Work Phone:  + 4 9 2 4 1 8 0 9 9 1 2 2 +49 241 80-99122 Work Send Email From the moment you begin your studies, you can start shaping a career path that aligns with your goals and aspirations. Our team is dedicated to guiding you at every step, offering personalized support to help you successfully navigate your career journey. Explore our tailored programs and services designed to help you transition seamlessly from university to the workforce, clarify your career goals, and achieve them. Similar Topics Career Center Footer Services Contact and Directions Legal Notice Privacy Policy Accessibility Statement Site Map Safety Feedback Glossary of Academic Terms Other Portals RWTHonline RWTHcontacts RWTHmoodle RWTH Jobs Portal University Library Athletics and Recreation Intranet RWTH in Simple English Further Institutions © 2026 RWTH Aachen University Social Media Instagram LinkedIn YouTube TikTok Facebook Threads BlueSky Mastodon RWTH Social Media"
