RWTH Jobs Portal Working at RWTH Working in RWTH’s Scientific Community Working in Management, Administration, Technology & IT Career & Personal Development RWTH Welcome Center Interesting Facts Living in Aachen and Beyond Sustainability Submenu: Sustainability Sustainability Strategy Sustainability Report Sustainability Mission Statement Sustainability Focus Areas Networks Help Build a Sustainable RWTH Newsletter, FAQ and Downloads Faculties Submenu: Faculties Faculty 1 Mathematics and Natural Sciences Faculty 2 Architecture Faculty 3 Civil Engineering Faculty 4 Mechanical Engineering Faculty 5 Georesources and Materials Engineering Faculty 6 Electrical Engineering and Information Technology Faculty 7 Arts and Humanities Faculty 8 Business and Economics Faculty 9 Computer Science Faculty 10 Medicine Information for... Quick Access Prospective Students First Year Students Students Early-Career Researchers Researchers International Alumni School Students Corporate Visitors Press Tools RWTHonline RWTHcontacts RWTHmoodle Intranet Services Dining Hall Menus RWTH Navigator Student Resources and Support Official Announcements Institutions University Library IT Center Center for Teaching and Learning Services Athletics and Recreation Central University Administration Search by Name Search for Search You Are Here: Start Transfer Recruiting Advertise Job Opportunities Advertise Job Opportunities Copyright: © Martin Braun Contact Career Center Work Send Email Companies have two convenient options for advertising job opportunities to RWTH graduates: Online Job Board Post your openings on our online job board to reach a broad pool of qualified candidates. Each listing is also shared with the relevant academic departments and student councils to maximize visibility. Fee: 150 euros per posting Duration: 21 days online Service: Automatic forwarding to appropriate contacts Career Center Bulletin Boards We also display postings on the Career Center bulletin boards located in the C.A.R.L. Lecture Hall Complex. Employers can upload announcements directly through our system. We also offer a limited number of postings for display only at no cost. For paid postings, please ensure that your billing address, VAT number, and any internal reference details are entered correctly during submission, as changes cannot be made afterward. Discounts & Support Discounts for multiple postings or extended booking periods are applied automatically through our online system. The Career Center team is also available for questions or to discuss tailored recruiting options . For more information on our broader range of recruiting services, please visit our Recruiting page. Downloads Terms and Conditions for the Publication of External Job Advertisements in the RWTH Career Center Jobs Database (de) (pdf: 205kb) Footer Services Contact and Directions Legal Notice Privacy Policy Accessibility Statement Site Map Safety Feedback Glossary of Academic Terms Other Portals RWTHonline RWTHcontacts RWTHmoodle RWTH Jobs Portal University Library Athletics and Recreation Intranet RWTH in Simple English Further Institutions © 2026 RWTH Aachen University Social Media Instagram LinkedIn YouTube TikTok Facebook Threads BlueSky Mastodon RWTH Social Media"
