ing at RWTH Working in RWTH’s Scientific Community Working in Management, Administration, Technology & IT Career & Personal Development RWTH Welcome Center Interesting Facts Living in Aachen and Beyond Sustainability Submenu: Sustainability Sustainability Strategy Sustainability Report Sustainability Mission Statement Sustainability Focus Areas Networks Help Build a Sustainable RWTH Newsletter, FAQ and Downloads Faculties Submenu: Faculties Faculty 1 Mathematics and Natural Sciences Faculty 2 Architecture Faculty 3 Civil Engineering Faculty 4 Mechanical Engineering Faculty 5 Georesources and Materials Engineering Faculty 6 Electrical Engineering and Information Technology Faculty 7 Arts and Humanities Faculty 8 Business and Economics Faculty 9 Computer Science Faculty 10 Medicine Information for... Quick Access Prospective Students First Year Students Students Early-Career Researchers Researchers International Alumni School Students Corporate Visitors Press Tools RWTHonline RWTHcontacts RWTHmoodle Intranet Services Dining Hall Menus RWTH Navigator Student Resources and Support Official Announcements Institutions University Library IT Center Center for Teaching and Learning Services Athletics and Recreation Central University Administration Search by Name Search for Search Grow with Us – Careers at RWTH Welcome to RWTH – Help Shape the Future With Us View All Current Job Openings Copyright: © Martin Braun Teaser Working at RWTH Join a dynamic academic community where every day brings new challenges and opportunities. At RWTH, we rely on the talent and dedication of our exceptional staff to drive innovation and achieve our mission. That’s why we invest in comprehensive professional development to support your growth and help you reach your full potential. Read More : Working at RWTH Copyright: © Martin Braun Explore Academic Career Paths Read More : Explore Academic Career Paths Copyright: © Martin Braun Explore Careers in Management, Administration, Technology & IT Read More : Explore Careers in Management, Administration, Technology & IT Working at RWTH: Benefits & More Copyright: © Martin Braun Career & Professional Development Our people are the key to excellence in research and teaching. That’s why we focus on recruiting and supporting motivated, skilled, and engaged employees across all areas of the University. More... Copyright: © Cora Straßburg Diversity RWTH  is dedicated to fostering a diverse, equitable, and inclusive community – one where everyone feels respected, supported, and empowered to succeed, no matter their background or identity. Change now to change tomorrow Copyright: © Martin Braun Family-Friendly University At RWTH, we’re committed to helping students, faculty, and staff successfully balance their work, studies, and family life. Support for Work–Life Balance Copyright: © Martin Braun Health & Wellness Life at a university can be demanding. That’s why RWTH prioritizes the health and well-being of our entire campus community – students, faculty, and staff alike. Explore Health & Wellness Resources Previous item Diversity Family-Friendly University Health & Wellness Next item Copyright: © Martin Braun Retirement Benefits RWTH employees may enroll in the Pension Institution of the German Federal and State Governments (VBL) – a robust pension scheme designed to support public service professionals over the long term. Copyright: © Peter Winandy Job Ticket To support sustainable commuting, RWTH offers subsidized public transportation passes that help make your daily travel more affordable and environmentally friendly. Job Ticket Copyright: © Martin Braun Employee Discounts As part of your benefits at RWTH, enjoy access to exclusive discounts from a wide range of well-known brands, retailers, and service providers. Previous item Retirement Benefits Job Ticket Employee Discounts Next item At RWTH Aachen University, we work to provide solutions to the challenges of the future, focusing on generating and transferring knowledge. We have wonderful workplaces here that are at the forefront of the world of tomorrow. For me personally, it is incredibly enriching to be able to work in such an environment and to contribute to these projects. We never tire of reinventing the future. Thomas Trännapp, Chancellor of RWTH Image © Martin Braun As Director of the Institute for Advanced Mining Technologies at RWTH Aachen University, I benefit from an extremely dynamic, international, and innovative environment. This environment is conducive to interdisciplinary research and cutting-edge teaching, and it is supported by dedicated teams and international networks. Prof. Dr.-Ing. Elisabeth Clausen,  Director of the Institute for Advanced Mining Technologies Image © Martin Braun Previous item Thomas Trännapp, Chancellor of RWTH Prof. Dr.-Ing. Elisabeth Clausen,  Director of the Institute for Advanced Mining Technologies Next item Paths to RWTH Teaser Copyright: © Mario Irrmischer Trainees Read More : Trainees Copyright: © Martin Braun Management, Administrative, Technical & IT Staff Read More : Management, Administrative, Technical & IT Staff Copyright: © Martin Braun Leadership Roles in Management, Administration, Technology & IT Read More : Leadership Roles in Management, Administration, Technology & IT Copyright: © Martin Braun Doctoral Candidates & Early-Career Researchers Read More : Doctoral Candidates & Early-Career Researchers Copyright: © Martin Braun Postdocs & Established Researchers Read More : Postdocs & Established Researchers Copyright: © Martin Braun Professors Read More : Professors Copyright: © Martin Braun Student and Graduate Assistants Read More : Student and Graduate Assistants Living in Aachen and Beyond Living in Aachen and the Surrounding Area Copyright: © Martin Braun Footer Services Contact and Directions Legal Notice Privacy Policy Accessibility Statement Site Map Safety Feedback Glossary of Academic Terms Other Portals RWTHonline RWTHcontacts RWTHmoodle RWTH Jobs Portal University Library Athletics and Recreation Intranet RWTH in Simple English Further Institutions © 2026 RWTH Aachen University Social Media Instagram LinkedIn YouTube TikTok Facebook Threads BlueSky Mastodon RWTH Social Media"
