r RWTH Jobs Portal Working at RWTH Working in RWTH’s Scientific Community Working in Management, Administration, Technology & IT Career & Personal Development RWTH Welcome Center Interesting Facts Living in Aachen and Beyond Sustainability Submenu: Sustainability Sustainability Strategy Sustainability Report Sustainability Mission Statement Sustainability Focus Areas Networks Help Build a Sustainable RWTH Newsletter, FAQ and Downloads Faculties Submenu: Faculties Faculty 1 Mathematics and Natural Sciences Faculty 2 Architecture Faculty 3 Civil Engineering Faculty 4 Mechanical Engineering Faculty 5 Georesources and Materials Engineering Faculty 6 Electrical Engineering and Information Technology Faculty 7 Arts and Humanities Faculty 8 Business and Economics Faculty 9 Computer Science Faculty 10 Medicine Information for... Quick Access Prospective Students First Year Students Students Early-Career Researchers Researchers International Alumni School Students Corporate Visitors Press Tools RWTHonline RWTHcontacts RWTHmoodle Intranet Services Dining Hall Menus RWTH Navigator Student Resources and Support Official Announcements Institutions University Library IT Center Center for Teaching and Learning Services Athletics and Recreation Central University Administration Search by Name Search for Search You Are Here: Start About RWTH Career Career & Personal Development Career & Personal Development Academic Career Development Career Development in Management, Administration, Technology & IT Staff Development at RWTH RWTH Center for Staff Development RWTH Center for Professional Leadership Investing in People. Building the Future. Copyright: © Martin Braun At RWTH, we believe in the potential of every individual – and in the powerful outcomes that emerge when personal growth aligns with the opportunities of a leading university of technology. With more than 10,000 dedicated employees, RWTH is more than just a workplace: it's a community for ideas, growth, and shaping the future. Career Development in Academia From doctoral studies to professorship: RWTH Aachen University supports academic staff with targeted programs and advisory services. More about career development in academia Copyright: © Martin Braun Career Development in Management, Administration, Technology & IT RWTH offers a wide range of opportunities for professional and personal development for employees in management, administration, technology, and IT. We support individual career paths through practical training programs and advanced training courses. More about career development in management, administration, technology & IT Copyright: © Martin Braun Unlimited Opportunities for Skills Development RWTH Aachen University has a unique structure for personnel and career development: three specialized competence centers offer clear points of contact for different target groups. Whether it's research funding and career advice for young scientists, targeted development of leadership skills for science and administration, or practical training for the demands of a modern, digital working world, the centers complement each other and they provide tailored support for the diverse development needs of our employees. How We Can Support You Copyright: © Martin Braun Center for Young Academics (CYA) Copyright: © Martin Braun Center for Staff Development (CSD) Copyright: © Martin Braun Center for Professional Leadership (CPL) Previous item Center for Young Academics (CYA) Center for Staff Development (CSD) Center for Professional Leadership (CPL) 1/3 Next item Develop Your Teaching Skills – Shape Your Career The Center for Teaching and Learning Services (CLS) at RWTH Aachen University supports faculty and staff in developing their teaching skills. Through practical offerings in university teaching methods, digital teaching, and innovative learning formats, the CLS strengthens your personal and professional development—for excellent teaching today and sustainable career paths tomorrow. Go to the Center for Teaching and Learning Services Copyright: © Mario Irrmischer Coaching, Team Development, and Individual Support Are you facing new challenges, either personally or with your team? Would you like to reflect on your professional role or resolve conflicts? Personnel development is more than just further training. We offer individual coaching, team development processes, and tailor-made workshops that are tailored to your specific needs. Our services help you to achieve clarity and to pursue your goals effectively. We will work with you to develop a customized solution. More on the topics of coaching and team development Copyright: © Martin Braun Connect. Exchange. Grow together. We want to bring people together at RWTH and promote interdisciplinary exchange between science, technology, and administration. Whether it's at Young Academics Day, welcome events, management circles, or formats such as “Postdoc Engage,” discover a wide range of opportunities to network, learn from each other, and shape the future of the university together on the Human Resources Development website . Copyright: © Martin Braun Changing Your Perspective & Lateral Development Opportunities At RWTH Aachen University, we don't see a career as just climbing the corporate ladder. Many of our employees want to deepen their expertise, take on new tasks, or gain interdisciplinary experience — without necessarily aiming for a management position. Whether it's through work shadowing , project work, or switching between academia and administration, we can help you to develop your professional interests and strengths. This allows you to expand your skills, gain new perspectives, and actively contribute to the further development of the University. Further instruments for personnel development Copyright: © Martin Braun Find Events and Subscribe to Mailing Lists! Our event database contains current continuing education offerings that you can filter by topic and target group. HR Development event database Stay up to date Subscribe to our mailing lists to receive regular updates on new offers, remaining places, and events. Doc info for doctoral candidates at RWTH, Uniklinik RWTH Aachen, Forschungszentrum Jülich, and Fraunhofer Institutes Doctoral Academy for members of the Doctoral Academy RWTH Postdocs and Mid-Level Faculty for RWTH postdocs and academic staff UKA Postdocs for UKA postdocs and academic staff Continuing Education for all technical and administrative staff BTV Managers for all managers in technical and administrative departments Get In Touch With Us Do you have any questions or would you like to have a personal consultation? Our team members at Department 12.0 are always happy to assist you with your individual development. Feel free to contact us by phone or email. We look forward to working with you to find the best solution for your needs. Contact Us For Advice Central University Administration Department 12.0 – Staff Development and Talent Management Work Phone:  + 4 9 2 4 1 8 0 9 9 6 3 2 +49 241 80-99632 Work Send Email Footer Services Contact and Directions Legal Notice Privacy Policy Accessibility Statement Site Map Safety Feedback Glossary of Academic Terms Other Portals RWTHonline RWTHcontacts RWTHmoodle RWTH Jobs Portal University Library Athletics and Recreation Intranet RWTH in Simple English Further Institutions © 2026 RWTH Aachen University Social Media Instagram LinkedIn YouTube TikTok Facebook Threads BlueSky Mastodon RWTH Social Media"
