ortal Working at RWTH Working in RWTH’s Scientific Community Working in Management, Administration, Technology & IT Career & Personal Development RWTH Welcome Center Interesting Facts Living in Aachen and Beyond Sustainability Submenu: Sustainability Sustainability Strategy Sustainability Report Sustainability Mission Statement Sustainability Focus Areas Networks Help Build a Sustainable RWTH Newsletter, FAQ and Downloads Faculties Submenu: Faculties Faculty 1 Mathematics and Natural Sciences Faculty 2 Architecture Faculty 3 Civil Engineering Faculty 4 Mechanical Engineering Faculty 5 Georesources and Materials Engineering Faculty 6 Electrical Engineering and Information Technology Faculty 7 Arts and Humanities Faculty 8 Business and Economics Faculty 9 Computer Science Faculty 10 Medicine Information for... Quick Access Prospective Students First Year Students Students Early-Career Researchers Researchers International Alumni School Students Corporate Visitors Press Tools RWTHonline RWTHcontacts RWTHmoodle Intranet Services Dining Hall Menus RWTH Navigator Student Resources and Support Official Announcements Institutions University Library IT Center Center for Teaching and Learning Services Athletics and Recreation Central University Administration Search by Name Search for Search You Are Here: Start About RWTH Career RWTH Jobs Portal RWTH Jobs Portal Professorship Opportunities Your Guide to the Jobs Portal Explore current job postings at RWTH right here! We are looking forward to receiving your application. Internal job offers are posted exclusively on the RWTH intranet ; simply search for “internal jobs.” Please be aware that our Jobs Portal does not include vocational training or dual training programs offered by RWTH. To apply for these, please reach out directly to the Vocational Training Department . For vacancies at the Faculty of Medicine, please refer to the job opportunities page of Uniklinik RWTH Aachen . Have questions about the RWTH Jobs Portal, other job advertisements, or need contacts? Our Jobs Portal information page has all the answers. Additionally, you’ll find more job offer links compiled under Related Topics at the bottom of this page. Search and filter Search Search for Filter Type of Position Undo Selection Academic Staff Technical and Administrative Employees Student Assistant Contract Duration Undo Selection Fixed-term employment Permanent employment Contract Type Undo Selection Full-time Full-time with the possibility of part-time Part-time Part-time 1/2 Part-time 3/4 Employment Status Undo Selection Employment as a Graduate Assistant Employment as a Student Assistant Employment under a regular employment contract Professional Experience Undo Selection Auxiliary staff Career entry Professional Management Position Undo Selection No Yes Language Undo Selection English German Doctoral Positions Undo Selection No Yes Subject Area Undo Selection Architecture Biology Business Administration and Engineering Business and Economics Central Institutions Central University Administration Chemistry Civil engineering Computer Science Earth Sciences and Geography Electrical Engineering and Information Technology Empirical Humanities Materials Science and Engineering Mathematics Mechanical engineering Philosophy Physics Raw Materials and Waste Management Society, Technology, and Human Factors RWTH Institution/Unit Undo Selection Center for Teaching and Learning Services Chair and Institute for Automotive Engineering Chair and Institute for Fluid Power Drives and Systems Chair and Institute for Machine Elements and Systems Engineering Chair and Institute for Materials Applications in Mechanical Engineering Chair and Institute of Combustion Technology Chair and Institute of Construction Management, Digital Engineering and Robotics in Construction Chair and Institute of Highway Engineering Chair and Institute of Mechanism Theory, Machine Dynamics and Robotics Chair and Institute of Structural Concrete Chair and Inst